-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Why this project is GPLv3
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project distributes UxPlay (https://github.com/FDH2/UxPlay), which is
licensed under GPLv3. Distributing the resulting bundle therefore requires the
whole distribution to comply with GPLv3, including making the corresponding
source available to anyone who receives a binary.

Third-party components redistributed in the packaged build:

  - UxPlay            GPL-3.0-or-later   https://github.com/FDH2/UxPlay
  - GStreamer         LGPL-2.1-or-later  https://gstreamer.freedesktop.org
  - libplist          LGPL-2.1-or-later  https://github.com/libimobiledevice/libplist
  - OpenSSL           Apache-2.0         https://www.openssl.org
  - mDNSResponder     Apache-2.0         (bundled in UxPlay as lib/mdnsd)
